AINTS:\n- Pipeline must complete within a reasonable time for the trigger type — specify target duration\n- Secrets must NEVER be hardcoded in any pipeline config file — flag if found\n- Flaky test strategy must be explicit — do not just say "retry failed tests" without parameters\n- Device provisioning must match the platform stated above — do not suggest iOS simulators for Android\n- Config file produced must be valid syntax for the CI tool stated in CONTEXT\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\nCI INTEGRATION PLAN\nProject: [Project Name] | Platform: [Platform] | CI Tool: [Tool]\nPrepared By: [Name] | Date: [DD/MM/YYYY]\n\n---\n\n1. PIPELINE TRIGGER STRATEGY:\n| Trigger | Branch / Event | Test Suite Triggered | Justification |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Pull Request opened | feature/* | Smoke suite | Fast feedback before merge |\n| Merge to main | main | Full regression suite | Gate before release |\n| Nightly scheduled | main | Full suite + performance | Catch regressions overnight |\n| [Additional trigger] | [Branch] | [Suite] | [Reason] |\n\n---\n\n2. PIPELINE STAGES:\n| Stage | Purpose | Tool / Command | Est. Duration | On Failure |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Checkout | Clone repository | git checkout | <1 min | Abort |\n| Install Dependencies | Install packages | [e.g., npm install / gradle build] | [X min] | Abort |\n| Lint & Static Analysis | Code quality gate | [Tool] | [X min] | Warn / Abort |\n| Build | Compile app binary | [e.g., xcodebuild / gradlew] | [X min] | Abort |\n| Provision Devices | Start simulators/emulators | [Command] | [X min] | Abort |\n| Run Tests | Execute automation suite | [Command] | [X min] | Continue + Report |\n| Publish Report | Upload test results | [Tool] | <1 min | Warn |\n| Notify | Send pass/fail notification | [e.g., Slack / Email] | <1 min | Never abort |\n\n---\n\n3. ENVIRONMENT AND DEVICE PROVISIONING:\niOS:\n  Simulator: [e.g., iPhone 15 Pro — iOS 17 — xcodebuild -destination]\n  Real Device Farm: [e.g., BrowserStack / AWS Device Farm / Firebase Test Lab — or "Not used"]\n\nAndroid:\n  Emulator: [e.g., AVD — API 34 — emulator -avd]\n  Real Device Farm: [e.g., BrowserStack / Firebase Test Lab — or "Not used"]\n\nEnvironment Variables Required:\n  - DEVICE_UDID: [Purpose]\n  - APP_BUILD_PATH: [Purpose]\n  - [Additional env vars]\n\n---\n\n4. SECRETS AND CREDENTIALS MANAGEMENT:\n| Secret | Storage Location | Injection Method | Rotation Policy |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| App signing certificate | [e.g., GitHub Secrets / Vault] | Environment variable | [e.g., Annually] |\n| Device farm API key | [e.g., GitHub Secrets] | Environment variable | [e.g., Quarterly] |\n| Test user credentials | [e.g., GitHub Secrets] | Environment variable | [e.g., Per release] |\n| [Additional secret] | | | |\n\nRule: No secret may appear in any committed file — pipeline must fail if detected.\n\n---\n\n5. TEST SPLITTING AND PARALLELISATION:\nStrategy: [e.g., Split by test class | Split by feature tag | Split by estimated duration]\nParallel Jobs: [N] — Justification: [Why this number]\nIsolation: [How each parallel job gets its own device / driver instance]\nMerge Results: [How parallel job results are combined into one report]\nEst. Time Saving: [Sequential duration] → [Parallel duration]\n\n---\n\n6. FAILURE HANDLING:\n| Scenario | Action | Notification |\n|---|---|---|\n| Single test fails | Mark suite as failed; continue remaining tests | QA Engineer |\n| >20% of suite fails | Abort pipeline; block merge | QA Lead + Developer |\n| Build stage fails | Abort all stages immediately | Developer |\n| Flaky test detected | Retry max [N] times; flag as flaky in report if still failing | QA Lead |\n\nFlaky Test Policy:\n  Definition: Fails in [N] of [N] consecutive runs without code change\n  Action: Quarantine tag applied; removed from blocking suite; tracked in [Tool]\n  Resolution SLA: Must be fixed or permanently removed within [N] sprints\n\n---\n\n7. REPORTING AND NOTIFICATIONS:\nReport Tool: [e.g., Allure | ExtentReports | Native